@startuml 08_顺序图_视频语音交互
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E6DA4
  ArrowFontSize 15
  LifeLineBorderColor #9DB8D2
  ParticipantBorderColor #2E6DA4
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  ParticipantFontSize 15
}
actor "老人" as E
participant "老人端 App" as EAPP
participant "看护平台服务端" as SRV
participant "消息推送服务" as PUSH
participant "家属端 App" as FAPP
participant "机器人终端" as ROB

E -> EAPP : 点击呼叫家属
EAPP -> SRV : 发起通话请求
SRV -> PUSH : 推送来电提醒
PUSH --> FAPP : 来电通知
FAPP -> SRV : 接听
SRV -> SRV : 建立信令会话
SRV -> ROB : 请求音视频中继
ROB --> SRV : 采集并上传媒体流
SRV --> EAPP : 下行视频流
SRV --> FAPP : 下行视频流
EAPP -> SRV : 语音上行
SRV --> FAPP : 转发语音
FAPP -> SRV : 挂断
SRV -> SRV : 结束会话并记录时长
SRV --> EAPP : 通话结束
@enduml
